e/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-24T11:25:55-08:00","id":1531435,"title":"","content":"I always did like the idea of the Tremere freaking out that Banu Haqim broke the curse and joined the Camarilla led by two potent ancients like Teygerius and Asrad. You can bet the rank and file of the clan were kept in the dark about Ur-Shugi return from topr and with a minor effort shredded there most potent spell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-24T12:06:07-08:00","id":1531436,"title":"","content":"I seem to recall it being walked back somewhat that breaking the curse was effortless on his part, but it's still impressive even if it took years and a lot of moving parts/blood sacrifices to arrange.<br /> <br /> That bit where Tegyrus shuts up the Tremere Justicar by outlining the Amr's speculation about exactly how the curse was cast in the first place is probably my favorite passage in the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3505,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","user":"Matt the Bruins fan","date":". 02-24-2024, 03:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt th