br /> I assume Beckett thought Hardestadt would attempt to bribe him into silence.<br /> <br /> But didn't realize that Hardestadt the Younger was Jurgen and more inclined to violence than modern Ventrue.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, his physical stats, according to TC2, are Celerity 5, Fortitude 5, Potence 6, Protean 4. He could've killed Becket in one round.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1914-davidiot","name":"davidiot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-11T01:58:19-07:00","id":1538414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>davidiot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1530670-what-beckett-s-jyhad-diary-plots-were-your-favorite-which-would-you-followed-up-on?p=1538411#post1538411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, his physical stats, according to TC2, are Celerity 5, Fortitude 5, Potence 6, Protean 4. He could've killed Becket in one round.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, Beckett had to wolf out of there as fast as he could and Hardestadt assigned Bell probably with the knowledge that, either way, he'd be one troublemaker down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-11T10:50:30-07:00","id":1538435,"title":"","content":"Beckett as you said really read the room wrong and that potent elders like there personal secrets to stay that way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-11T12:46:09-07:00","id":1538442,"title":"","content":"I'll mention one that I'm surprised no one has brought up yet. <b>Theresia the Songbird </b>and the <b>Stoneman's</b> centuries long mini-sect of Bloodlines, Autarkis, and other outcasts.<br /> <br /> The party Beckett gets invited to is just wild. An Ahriman is more notable than a Balli. Dapper gargoyles. Samedi, Harbingers, and Nagaraja already rubbing shoulders. And it only gets wilder from there.<br /> <br /> Evidently this gathering has been happening for centuries in under the noses of the Camarilla in France. Also the notorious and elusive Stoneman is there (the most concrete evidence we have of his actual existence outside stories the catiff tell each other to feel better). They're responsible for the Blood Plague that swept through Berlin. They've been feeding information to the Society of Leopold for centuries. They're the secret puppet masters behind the Second Inquisition. They have plans to wipe the whole board clean, scatter and disempower the clans, and assume their rightful place as Heirs to the Eternal Night.<br /> <br /> Except no. Of course this was all just a little bit of friendly hazing. A test if you will. And of course you passed, Beckett. Of course we will welcome you into our confidence. Except, no, the Stoneman will not be seeing you tonight. I assure you it is not because you just threatened everyone here with exposure and certain death.<br /> <br /> Yep, it was all just a joke. Of course. That's all it was. Unless...<br /> <br /> The fact is I love Bloodlines. I love their niche positions in their sects and the Jihad in general. Frankly I find them much more tasteful then the ethnicity based clans. Sometimes I think the ethnic clans would have worked better as regional bloodlines. Or they should be excised from the game entirely and let a thousand bloodlines bloom. I love the way bloodlines make the world much stranger. The way some of them problematize or contradict otherwise accepted facts of Kindred history up to and including the Caine myth.<br /> <br /> I also like the way this new sect sort of mirrors forum games we've played here and on RPG.net. The type of game where you use a randomizer to select clans and bloodlines to fulfill positions in the sects, or as the High and Low clans. So you end up with things like Ravnos running the Camarilla. Gargoyles as a high clan. Tremere as Sabbat leaders. Theresia and Stoneman are attempting to do this in world and for that i respect them. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6350-marcusvitel","name":"MarcusVitel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-12T02:52:29-07:00","id":1538469,"title":"","content":"I created the Omega sect in that last chapter partly to justify that yes, bloodlines are perfectly playable and can be incorporated into the usual sectarian games, and also as something emblematic of the omega state of Vampire, i.e., once you've run through all your Ventrue, Toreador, and Brujah characters, you're left with a coterie of freaks, weirdos, snowflakes, and infernalists. It's the last resort for the jaded Vampire player.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-12T14:35:45-07:00","id":1538492,"title":"","content":"I'm waiting for another sect to come into existence at some point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}